// Sulicena, headwoman of Vindomagos. Reads nothing, knows everyone.
// Gives the ford quest; points to readers for the tally.
=== start
[flag sul_met] -> again
~ set sul_met
The headwoman of Vindomagos is counting sacks in her own storeroom, and makes you wait until she's done. Then she looks at your boots, your cloak, your face.

"Cadurci. From up the hill." She says it the way a trader names a coin. "Brigodunon, by the look of you. I'm Sulicena. What does Vellaunos want? He only sends people when he wants something."
-> hub

=== again
[flag levy_vindomagos, !flag sul_levy] -> levy_angry
"Back again." She doesn't stop counting. "Go on."
-> hub

=== hub
